<div class="doc-header"><span class="doc-org">ЦК КПСС · Секретариат</span><span class="doc-sub"><<clue "cipher-telegram">><<ru "shifrotelegramma" "Шифротелеграмма">><</clue>> · проект (draft)</span></div>
<div class="doc-meta"><span>To: first secretaries of republican Central Committees, kraikoms and <<ru "obkom" "obkoms">></span><span>Copies: 1</span></div>
<p class="doc-title">On measures in connection with the state of emergency</p>

In connection with the introduction of a <<ru "chp">> in certain areas of the USSR, Party committees are to take measures to support the State Committee on the State of Emergency.

Ensure that Communists in the soviets, the economy and the law-enforcement bodies assist in maintaining order. Do not permit meetings, strikes or the distribution of unauthorised publications. Report on the situation in your region by 18:00 Moscow time daily.

<p class="doc-sign">Secretariat of the Central Committee</p>

<div class="routing-slip"><table>
<tr><th>Рег. № · reg. no.</th><td>0417/с</td></tr>
<tr><th>Дата регистрации · registered</th><td><<clue "reg-date-14">>14.08.91<</clue>></td></tr>
<tr><th>К пакету · filed with</th><td><<clue "packet-7s">>№ 7/С<</clue>></td></tr>
</table></div>
<p class="margin-note">Отправить 19.08 в 07:00. — Р.</p>
<p class="doc-translation">Handwritten: “Send 19.08 at 07:00. — R.” This draft was registered on 14 August, five days before the State Committee announced itself.</p>
<div class="doc-footer"><em>Fictional document created for this game</em>, modeled on a real episode: <<note "secretariat-telegram">></div>
